{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795330885,"nonce":"EprYY/cBpsM51aU5eJyILSR4RJA=","title":"Redaction: leading_suffix stores the tail of a whole secret that starts a part, depending on chunking","message":"Found by the ADR-0082 red team 2026-11-22 (review/adr-redteam.md in ~/.afk/scrarab-ci/20261122-1206). crates/scarab-server/src/logs.rs:866 leading_suffix: with values V1=abcdefghijkl and V2=efghijklMNOPQRST and a part that starts with V2 delivered as chunks 'efghijkl' + 'MNOPQRST', the first call (not at_end) finds V1's 8-byte suffix, the whole-value check at :883 fails because buf is shorter than V2, so it returns Len(8): '***' is emitted and 'MNOPQRST' is later stored in clear. Delivered as one chunk, V2 wins and is redacted whole. Applies in 0.7.0 at the start of a part after source_restarted. Fix: stay Undecided while !at_end and a longer whole value could still match (v.len() \u003e buf.len() \u0026\u0026 v.starts_with(buf)); add an any-chunking property test.","files":null}]}